    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7678" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατυπ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>describe, represent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				1.19
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Her.</u>
				2.19
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			):—
				Med.
			, <i>form an image of</i> a thing, <i>imagine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.329b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				331d
			</span></i>; <i>represent</i> in writing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἐπιστολάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					1.32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>remodel, transform,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀνθρωπίνην περὶ τοῦ δαιμονίου
					δόξαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					12.26
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antim.
				81
			</span></i>.</div>
